    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja kucha kwa BWANA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose waghamba, “Ituku jiacha wandu wikukasire na wawiwi wose wichakorwa sa makanda. Ituku ijo wichakorwa hata mndungi usesigho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela konyu inyo munisikiragha, ndighi ra kukia kwapo richam'bukia sa iruwa, nenyo mchaboiswa. Mchaghenda mkirama-rama sa ngache rafuma wazenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku nichaakatisha agho, mchawifasha-fasha wawiwi aisi ya maghu ghenyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kumbukenyi mafundisho gha mdumiki wapo Musa; sharia na memu neremnekieghe aja Mghondi ghwa Sinai kwa wundu ghwa wandu wose wa Israeli wipate kusikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
